# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes CRLF,
# which makes `gofmt -l .` (and therefore scripts/check.ps1) fail even though
# the committed blobs are LF. Marking text=auto keeps genuine binary files
# untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
